# Profile: Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32-S3 Plus (bench tests, no display).
# Applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults:
#
#   idf.py -B build-xiao -D SDKCONFIG=build-xiao/sdkconfig \
#          -D "SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS=sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.xiao" build
#
# or simply firmware/tools/build_dist.sh (builds both boards + merged images).
#
# Hardware, checked against the Seeed wiki ("XIAO ESP32S3 Plus": ESP32-S3R8,
# 8 MB PSRAM, 16 MB flash) and the arduino-esp32 board definition
# "XIAO_ESP32S3_Plus" (bootloader QIO @ 80 MHz, 16 MB, PSRAM option "OPI"):
#   - ESP32-S3R8: the 8 MB PSRAM is inside the chip package and always octal
#     (same chip as on the Waveshare board),
#   - 16 MB external SPI flash, QIO capable,
#   - user LED on GPIO21 (active low), BOOT button on GPIO0,
#   - console on the native USB port (USB-Serial-JTAG), no USB-UART bridge.

CONFIG_MS_BOARD_XIAO_ESP32S3_PLUS=y

# --- Flash: 16 MB, quad I/O @ 80 MHz ----------------------------------------
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_16MB=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHMODE_QIO=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHFREQ_80M=y

# --- PSRAM: 8 MB octal @ 80 MHz (repeated from sdkconfig.defaults on purpose:
#     this profile must not depend on the Waveshare defaults staying the same)
CONFIG_SPIRAM=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM_MODE_OCT=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM_SPEED_80M=y

# --- Console: native USB -------------------------------------------------------
CONFIG_ESP_CONSOLE_USB_SERIAL_JTAG=y

# Heap statistics once a minute instead of every 10 s: the periodic log line
# would otherwise keep interrupting typing in the serial console. The console
# command "status" shows the same numbers on demand.
CONFIG_MS_HEAP_LOG_PERIOD_S=60

# --- No credentials in the image -------------------------------------------------
# The bench image is flashed as a prebuilt file; WiFi and Spotify credentials are
# entered on the serial console and stored in NVS. To build an image with
# build-time credentials anyway, list sdkconfig.secrets AFTER this file.
CONFIG_MS_WIFI_SSID=""
CONFIG_MS_WIFI_PASSWORD=""
CONFIG_MS_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=""
CONFIG_MS_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=""
